      "note": "Reviewed the successful BSC receipt and call trace, the pinned DeFiHackLabs reproduction, the DDC creation receipt, and historical runtime code. The trace calls handleDeductFee on DDC with the DDC/USDT pair as the debited address, then syncs and sells the removed DDC. DDC was created directly at 20837907:10 by 0x1a8def16f2b9a69743fb301f82bd61ddfa65f7f6; code was absent one block earlier and runtime hash 0x948012cb...59e4 is identical at deployment and immediately before exploitation. The receipt's USDT transfers reconcile as 1.368537570861681076 into the pair and 110,106.024385302142604310 out, measuring exact net pair depletion of 110,104.655847731280923234 USDT."
